      ],
      "plan": "Detail a hypothetical procedure for testing offline local LLMs. Include the ability to download models beforehand and the two main verification points: text generation and network request monitoring. Clearly state that this is a hypothetical scenario without actual test data. Encourage focused discussion on the proposed steps."
